Module LAPT_1RB0RA_1LC0RB_0LC1LD_1RD0LA.
(** * LAPT_1RB0RA_1LC0RB_0LC1LD_1RD0LA: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0RA_1LC0RB_0LC1LD_1RD0LA, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

