Module LAPT_1RB0RA_1LC0RD_0RA0LB_1LB1RB.
(** * LAPT_1RB0RA_1LC0RD_0RA0LB_1LB1RB: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0RA_1LC0RD_0RA0LB_1LB1RB, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

    Auto-emitted by tools/counters/emit_lapcert.py (UNTRUSTED emitter; the Coq
    kernel re-runs the checker on every line below).  Left-growth binary
