    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StD, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0RB_0LC0RA_1LD0LD_1RA1LC [SWinR 2; SRotL 1; SWin 1] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

