             run_boot_1RB0RB_0LC0RA_1RA0LD_0RB1LC [] [] j ltac:(reflexivity) ltac:(reflexivity)).
  - exists (4 * j + 10), (cden [] [] j B1_1RB0RB_0LC0RA_1RA0LD_0RB1LC).
