    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0RB_0LC1RD_1RB1LC_0LD1RA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0RB_0LC1RD_1RB1LC_0LD1RA p j' E).
    + lia.
